.SH "prelude\&.ls [![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/gkz/prelude-ls.png?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/gkz/prelude-ls)"
.PP
is a functionally oriented utility library\&. It is powerful and flexible\&. Almost all of its functions are curried\&. It is written in, and is the recommended base library for, \fRLiveScript\fP\&.

.PP
See \fB\fRthe prelude\&.ls site\fP\fP for examples, a reference, and more\&.

.PP
You can install via npm \fRnpm install prelude-ls\fP
.SS "Development"
\fRmake test\fP to test

.PP
\fRmake build\fP to build \fRlib\fP from \fRsrc\fP

.PP
\fRmake build-browser\fP to build browser versions 
